@startuml
title <size:24>Component View: Vectispire Platform - Spring Boot Control Plane</size>\n<size:24>Level 3: the control plane modules, generated from the Spring Modulith model, shared foundation modules in a lighter tone</size>

set separator none
top to bottom direction

<style>
  root {
    BackgroundColor: #ffffff
    FontColor: #444444
  }
</style>

